d as Biologics License Applications (BLAs), Premarket Approvals (PMAs), New Drug Applications (NDAs) or 510Ks.\nL96: ### Biologics License Applications and Supplements\nL97: \nL98: New BLAs (except those for blood banking), and BLA supplements that are expected to significantly enhance the public health (e.g., for new/expanded indications, new routes of administration, new dosage formulations and improved safety).\nL99: \nL100:   * 【56†2021 Biological License Application Approvals】\nL101:   * 【57†2021 Biological License Application Supplement Noteworthy Approvals】\nL102: ### Other Applications Approved or Cleared by the Center for Biologics Evaluation and Research (CBER)\nL103: \nL104: Medical devices involved in the collection, processing, testing, manufacture and administration of licensed blood, blood components and cellular products.\nL105: \nL106:   * 【58†2021 Biological Device Application Approvals】\nL107: ### Key Resources\nL108: \nL109:   * 【43†Development & Approval Process (CBER)】\nL110:   * 【59†Biologics Products & Establishments】\nL111:   * 【60†Transfer of Therapeutic Products to the Center for Drug Evaluation and Research - Archived】\nL112: ## Footer Links\nL113: \nL114:   * 【61†FDA Archive】\nL115:   * 【28†About FDA】\nL116:   * 【62†Accessibility】\nL117: \nL118:   * 【63†Visitor Information】\nL119:   * 【64†Website Policies / Privacy】\nL120:   * 【65†No FEAR Act】\nL121:   * 【66†Vulnerability Disclosure Policy】\nL122: \nL123:   * 【67†FOIA】\nL124:   * 【68†HHS.gov】\nL125:   * 【69†USA.gov】\nL126: \nL127: 【13†Contact FDA】 【70†Follow FDA on Facebook】 【71†Follow FDA on X】 【72†Follow FDA on Instagram】\nL128: 【73†Follow FDA on LinkedIn】 【74†View FDA videos on YouTube】 【75†Subscribe to FDA RSS feeds】\nL129: \nL130: 【10†FDA Homepage】\nL131: Contact Number 1-888-INFO-FDA (1-888-463-6332)\nL132: \nL133: Back to Top\n"
